<title>UK: Statkraft sets 400 mln Danish crown seven-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Statkraft sets 400 mln Danish crown seven-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Den Danske Bank and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATKRAFT</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    30.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.42    PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.0 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
